 "_readme": "Serial numbering of the Sarvamula granthas of Sri Madhvacharya -- the spine every other id in the corpus hangs from. SM13 is Anuvyakhyana; SM13.3 is its third tika; SM13.3.1 is a commentary ON that tika. A unit inside any of them is <code>:<n>, e.g. SM13.3:412. Replaces the imported site's own record numbers (see tools/renumber_origin_ids.py); the mapping back lives in Parabuddhi and nowhere else.",
